{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "松本和子(まつもとわこ)です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "開いてくださり、ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobOk8ND8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobHRd0tj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thシングル リアルミート＆グリート in幕張"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "天候もよくない中、来てくださった皆さんありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "遠くから会いにきてくれたり、\n湿気もあったのに髪を整えてきてくれたり、\n朝からメイクをしてきてくれたり、\nお洋服を選んできてくれたり、\n名札を作ってきてくれたり、\n話すことを考えてきてくれたり、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全部気づいてますからね〜〜\n愛おしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうすぐ夏なので、浴衣を着ました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん褒めてもらえて嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しあわせでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "東京の夏祭りとか、花火大会は人が多くて苦手なのですが、お話ししてるうちに行きたくなっちゃったな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに屋台は、綿飴とあんず飴が好きです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お砂糖が好きなのかも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobFsNqXw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お花もたくさんありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どれもすごく可愛くて、写真を撮ったり自慢したりして喜んでました♩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵なメッセージもありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob7q9bKS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobXT6CVQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近のミーグリのわこさん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして先日、\n『We got your back』のMVが公開されました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/VD38V6K9lyI?si=LXSF34EkB9_QmQCd"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かっこいい作品になっています！\n是非ご覧ください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/moburziRc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobX3MZ9e.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}